Error: Jet.UnknownArgumentLabel: `keep_open` has no parameter labeled `slot`
  --> Tests/UI/process_keep_open_label_unknown.jet:8:48
    |
  8 |     _: process.cmd(["true"]).keep_open(reader, slot: 9)
